{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29603","headline":"隋宫守岁 · 李商隐","name":"隋宫守岁","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"消息东郊木帝回，宫中行乐有新梅。\n沈香甲煎爲庭燎，玉液琼苏作寿杯。\n遥望露盘疑是月，远闻鼍鼓欲惊雷。\n昭阳第一倾城客，不踏金莲不肯来。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李商隐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_29603.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29603","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}